### Exemplos para a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code (ou o HTTP Client do JetBrains).
### Suba a API (docker compose up -d) e rode o seed:  docker compose --profile seed run --rm seed

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Login como administrador (criado pelo seed)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "admin-senha-123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Criar um recurso (admin)
# @name createResource
POST {{host}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sala Nova", "description": "Projetor", "capacity": 6 }

###
@resourceId = {{createResource.response.body.id}}

### 3. Ver horários livres do recurso
GET {{host}}/resources/{{resourceId}}/availability?from=2027-03-01T08:00:00Z&to=2027-03-01T18:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Reservar (intervalo em múltiplos de 15 min; entre 15 min e 8 h; no futuro)
# @name booking
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-01T14:00:00Z", "endsAt": "2027-03-01T15:30:00Z", "notes": "Reunião" }

### 5. Tentar de novo no mesmo horário -> 409 BOOKING_OVERLAP
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-01T14:30:00Z", "endsAt": "2027-03-01T15:00:00Z" }

### 6. Cancelar
POST {{host}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Minhas reservas
GET {{host}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
